*> PLB-C088 accept-truncation: ACCEPT of the date or time into a
*> numeric item with too few digits.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTRUNC.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-TIME             PIC 9(6).
01  WS-DATE             PIC 9(6).
01  WS-SHORT            PIC 9(4).
01  WS-PACKED           PIC 9(5) COMP-3.
01  WS-RATE             PIC 9(4)V99.
01  WS-STAMP.
    05  WS-HOURS        PIC 9(6) OCCURS 2.
01  WS-OTHER.
    05  WS-HOURS-2      PIC 9(4).
01  WS-FULL-TIME        PIC 9(8).
01  WS-FULL-DATE        PIC 9(8).
01  WS-JULIAN           PIC 9(7).
01  WS-TEXT-TIME        PIC X(6).
01  WS-TEXT-DATE        PIC X(6).
01  WS-BINARY           PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01  WS-WEEKDAY          PIC 9.
01  WS-SCALED           PIC 9(4)PP.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Reported.
    ACCEPT WS-TIME FROM TIME
    ACCEPT WS-DATE FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
    ACCEPT WS-SHORT FROM DATE
    ACCEPT WS-PACKED FROM DAY YYYYDDD
    ACCEPT WS-RATE FROM TIME
    ACCEPT WS-HOURS(2) FROM TIME
    ACCEPT WS-HOURS-2 OF WS-OTHER FROM TIME
    ACCEPT WS-SHORT FROM DAY END-ACCEPT
    *> Not reported: wide enough, alphanumeric, binary, P scaling.
    ACCEPT WS-FULL-TIME FROM TIME
    ACCEPT WS-FULL-DATE FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
    ACCEPT WS-DATE FROM DATE
    ACCEPT WS-JULIAN FROM DAY YYYYDDD
    ACCEPT WS-TEXT-TIME FROM TIME
    ACCEPT WS-TEXT-DATE FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
    ACCEPT WS-BINARY FROM TIME
    ACCEPT WS-WEEKDAY FROM DAY-OF-WEEK
    ACCEPT WS-SCALED FROM TIME
    DISPLAY WS-TIME WS-DATE WS-SHORT WS-PACKED WS-RATE WS-STAMP
        WS-OTHER WS-FULL-TIME WS-FULL-DATE WS-JULIAN WS-TEXT-TIME
        WS-TEXT-DATE WS-BINARY WS-WEEKDAY WS-SCALED
    STOP RUN.
